//-----------------------------------------------------------
= Projects
//-----------------------------------------------------------

#grid(
  columns: (1fr, auto),
  [*Synergy Zyklen — Referral & Reward Platform | Final Year Project*], [July 2026 -- Jun 2027],
)
#v(0.4em)
#set list(spacing: 0.4em, indent: 0em)

- Full-stack development of a cycle-based referral and reward platform, digitising a manual profit-sharing model into an automated web system.
- Built the core cycle engine in PHP/Laravel: sales are tracked in cycles of 1 to 12 units, and each completed cycle automatically credits RM 18 to the buyer and RM 6 to the referrer.
- Laravel MVC backend with Eloquent ORM and Blade templates over PostgreSQL, role-based authentication for buyers, referrers and administrators, and integration for payouts. Deployed on Hostinger.
- Delivered an in-house POS module for Walla Cafe on a staff-exclusive route within the same codebase, replacing their third-party system:
  - Menu management, receipt printing and payments.
  - Zyklen cycle and reward logic wired directly into the sales flow, so café purchases feed the reward model.
  - Tablet-and-Bluetooth-printer deployment.
  - Documented internet dependency as a known limitation of the web-based POS approach.
- Worked in a team of 3 across the full stack: database design, backend logic, and frontend views.

